== Effect ==
* Increases the [[knockback]] of Isaac's tears.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either further increases knockback. Having both further increases knockback again.

== Tips ==
* This trinket is useful against chasing enemies and enemies that explode upon death such as {{E|Mulliboom}}s or {{E|Boom Fly|text=Boom Flies}}.

== Interactions ==
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|8 Inch Nails}} / {{i|Pisces}}: The knockback increases are the same and do not stack.
* {{i|Brimstone}}: The beam pushes back enemies.
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique|nr}}: The controlled tear gains knockback.
** {{dlc|r}}: No effect.
* {{i|Mom's Box}}: No effect.
* {{i|Mom's Knife}}: The knife pushes back enemies.
* {{i|Tech.5}} / {{i|Technology}} / {{i|Technology 2}}: The laser pushes back enemies.
* {{i|Tech X|nr}}: The knockback direction is counter-clockwise around the ring.
** {{dlc|r}} Enemies are knocked back in the ring's fired direction.
* {{i|Revelation}}: The beam pushes back enemies.
* {{i|Trisagion}}: The blast slightly pushes back enemies.

